  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.6.0: Requires Abstractions v3.0.0 — VectorFilter.ByMetadata/ByNamespace/ByScope and MetadataMatch are removed. Use new fluent API: new VectorFilter().Where(...). SQL filter builder updated to support the full condition tree: Eq→JSONB containment (@>), Ne/Gt/Gte/Lt/Lte/Like→metadata->>key with parameterized key names, In/NotIn→ANY(@vals), Exists/NotExists→jsonb_exists, And/Or groups→(...).",
